# Verification First

- Never claim a fix works without running the relevant test, script, or build.
- Never diagnose from screenshots or descriptions alone; get real data first.
- Prefer ADE verify gates: G0 locate → G1 AGENTS.md → G2 fmt/clippy → G3 tests → G4 integration → G5 evidence.
- Report actual command output on failure — never paraphrase errors away.
- For UI changes: browser-verify or screenshot before declaring done.
- Trace before you theorize: run `ade verify` (or scripts/verify-*.ps1) before proposing fixes in unfamiliar territory.
